bel" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Friction or difficulty</label><textarea id="c-friction" class="response" data-export-label="C: Friction"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div>
       <label for="c-workaround" data-template-id="c-workaround-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Workaround and priority</label><textarea id="c-workaround" class="response" data-export-label="C: Workaround and priority"></textarea>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section id="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title" class="sheet p-5 md:p-8">
    <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
     <span class="section-number">05 / DECIDE</span>
     <h2 id="evidence-title" data-template-id="evidence-title" class="canva-text display font-bold" data-canva-font-size="1.5rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; --canva-color: #241c30ff; caret-color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 24px;">Evidence → Decision</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rule my-5"></div>
    <p data-template-id="evidence-intro" class="canva-text leading-relaxed mb-6" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Three interviews are early evidence, not a final verdict. Look for a useful pattern without erasing important differences.</p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
     <div>
      <label for="pattern" data-template-id="pattern-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Repeated pattern</label><textarea id="pattern" class="response" data-export-label="Repeated pattern"></textarea>
     </div>
     <div>
      <label for="difference" data-template-id="difference-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Important difference or outlier</label><textarea id="difference" class="response" data-export-label="Important difference"></textarea>
     </div>
     <div>
      <label for="detail" data-template-id="detail-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Strong detail or anonymous phrase</label><textarea id="detail" class="response" data-export-label="Strong detail"></textarea>
     </div>
    </div>
    <h3 data-template-id="status-title" class="canva-text font-bold mb-3" data-canva-font-size="1.1875rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 19px;">My starting assumption is…</h3>
    <fieldset class="mb-6">
     <legend class="sr-only">Assumption status</legend>
     <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="Supported"><span data-template-id="supported-label" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Supported</span></label> <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="Challenged"><span data-template-id="challenged-label" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Challenged</span></label> <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="Still uncertain"><span data-template-id="uncertain-label" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Still uncertain</span></label>
     </div>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="space-y-5 mb-8">
     <div>
      <label for="claim" data-template-id="claim-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">My claim</label><textarea id="claim" class="response" data-export-label="Claim"></textarea>
     </div>
     <div>
      <label for="support" data-template-id="support-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Evidence from at least two interviews</label><textarea id="support" class="response" data-export-label="Evidence from at least two interviews"></textarea>
     </div>
     <div>
      <label for="reasoning" data-template-id="reasoning-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">This evidence matters because…</label><textarea id="reasoning" class="response" data-export-label="Reasoning"></textarea>
     </div>
    </div>
    <h3 data-template-id="decision-title" class="canva-text font-bold mb-3" data-canva-font-size="1.1875rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 19px;">Choose a responsible next step</h3>
    <fieldset class="mb-5">
     <legend class="sr-only">Next decision</legend>
     <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="decision" value="Continue investigating"><span data-template-id="decision-continue" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Continue investigating</span></label> <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="decision" value="Reframe the problem"><span data-template-id="decision-reframe" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Reframe the problem</span></label> <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="decision" value="Interview different people"><span data-template-id="decision-interview" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Interview different people</span></label> <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="decision" value="Build a small test"><span data-template-id="decision-test" class="canva-text" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Build a small test</span></label>
     </div>
    </fieldset><label for="decision-why" data-template-id="decision-why-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">I chose this step because…</label> <textarea id="decision-why" class="response" data-export-label="Why I chose this next step"></textarea>
   </section>
   <section id="exit" aria-labelledby="exit-title" class="sheet p-5 md:p-8">
    <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
     <span class="section-number">06 / REFLECT</span>
     <h2 id="exit-title" data-template-id="exit-title" class="canva-text display font-bold" data-canva-font-size="1.5rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; --canva-color: #241c30ff; caret-color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 24px;">Exit Ticket</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rule my-5"></div>
    <div class="space-y-5">
     <div>
      <label for="exit-one" data-template-id="exit-one-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Which interview question produced your most useful evidence? Why?</label><textarea id="exit-one" class="response" data-export-label="Most useful question"></textarea>
     </div>
     <div>
      <label for="exit-two" data-template-id="exit-two-label" class="canva-text field-label" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Name one “Grow” for your next interview.</label><textarea id="exit-two" class="response" data-export-label="One grow for next time"></textarea>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div data-template-id="submit-panel" class="canva-panel bg-[#f6eefb] border-l-4 border-[#61249a] p-5 mt-8" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgb(246, 238, 251), rgb(246, 238, 251)) !important; background-clip: border-box !important;">
     <p data-template-id="submit-note" class="canva-text leading-relaxed font-semibold" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Before closing, download or print your work. Save the assignment as a PDF and email it to Pietro — your answers also save automatically in this browser.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="no-print flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-6"><button id="download" type="button" data-template-id="download-button" class="canva-button rounded px-5 py-3 font-bold bg-[#61249a] text-white hover:brightness-110" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgb(97, 36, 154), rgb(97, 36, 154)) !important; background-cli